---
args: { questions: DispositiveQuestionSet, pages: EvidencePage[] }
returns: QuestionEvidenceLedger
---
For each disputed question, test relevance, scope, time fit, source authority, provenance and consistency. Separate authenticity checks from semantic support. Collapse copies of the same record for weight but preserve independent corroboration. Detail or confidence in a private-party submission alone is not conclusive.
